<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">22042026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran has refused to negotiate under threat as the United States truce expires Wednesday, and Tehran has accused Washington of piracy at the United Nations after US forces seized the Iranian vessel Toska off Oman.</s> <s>Iran's UN ambassador argued the interdiction lacks Security Council authorization, while President Trump told reporters the military is, in his words, raring to go.</s> <s>Pakistan's mediating delegation waits in Islamabad with no confirmation Iran's team will attend.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>France is hosting Lebanese Prime Minister Nawaf Salam in Paris as Lebanon seeks five hundred million euros to cover six months of humanitarian need.</s> <s>Israeli strikes have killed two thousand two hundred ninety-four people in Lebanon since March, and Paris has found itself excluded from Washington talks by Israel and the United States.</s> <s>Macron is pressing for sovereignty guarantees while the country's regional patrons negotiate over its head.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan has extended its airspace closure to Indian carriers until the twenty-fourth of May, marking one full year since the ban began.</s> <s>Indian airlines are rerouting transcontinental flights south over the Arabian Sea, absorbing extra fuel burn and crew costs on every westbound trip.</s> <s>No bilateral talks are scheduled, and the cost now compounds daily into the next summer travel season.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Hundreds of Gaza university students rallied in Gaza City demanding the right to leave for scholarships already granted abroad.</s> <s>Israel has authorized no student exits, and Rafah reopened in February for medical cases only — these students hold admission letters and visas but cannot reach the border.</s> <s>No authority has agreed to classify students alongside humanitarian exceptions.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Ukrainian drones struck an apartment block in the Russian city of Syzran, collapsing one entrance of the building.</s> <s>Four people including a child were pulled from the rubble, and the governor of Samara region said drone attacks are continuing across the area.</s> <s>The Samara region sits more than eight hundred kilometres from the Ukrainian border, a reach that has expanded steadily through this war.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The European Court of Justice has voided Hungary's ban on LGBTQ content, invoking for the first time Article Two of the EU Treaty against a member state.</s> <s>That is the clause on foundational values — dignity, equality, human rights — and every government's morality legislation now faces the same human-rights test.</s> <s>Incoming Prime Minister Magyar, who needs eighteen billion euros in frozen EU funds, inherits the ruling.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nigeria's primary healthcare agency has recovered nearly sixty million naira in misappropriated funds through its field-officer audit programme.</s> <s>Per-facility grants have been raised from three hundred thousand to eight hundred thousand naira quarterly, and a financial-monitoring app is now running in fourteen states.</s> <s>A rare African governance story where institutions audited themselves and returned the money.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In the United States, Florida Congresswoman Sheila Cherfilus-McCormick has resigned ahead of an expulsion vote after being charged with laundering five million dollars in federal disaster funds into her twenty twenty-one campaign.</s> <s>Prosecutors say the money, meant for hurricane relief, flowed through her family's healthcare firm.</s> <s>Her trial on eleven federal fraud counts tightens the Democratic margin by one seat.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Britain, the sacked head of the Foreign Office has told lawmakers that security vetting advised against appointing Peter Mandelson to Washington, yet Downing Street pushed the appointment through anyway.</s> <s>Olly Robbins described direct pressure from the prime minister's office to fast-track the clearance.</s> <s>Calls for Keir Starmer's resignation are intensifying as the vetting row widens.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Six defendants including a hotel owner are standing trial in Istanbul for the phosphine gas deaths of a Hamburg family of four.</s> <s>Prosecutors say aluminium phosphide pesticide, banned from occupied rooms, was applied while the family slept — the defendants face up to twenty-two years.</s> <s>Turkey has promised stricter hotel inspections, though no new national safety framework has been tabled.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>China has opened hourly carbon data for its electricity grid, mapped province by province out to twenty sixty.</s> <s>The dataset covers thirty-one provinces and five development scenarios, letting firms and planners price the carbon cost of where they locate a factory.</s> <s>Twenty sixty is Beijing's carbon neutrality target year, and the forecast has been validated against historical emissions.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>NASA's Curiosity rover has detected seven organic compounds in a Martian rock, five of them never seen before on the planet.</s> <s>All survived three and a half billion years sealed in clay-rich sediment, including a compound also found in living cells on Earth.</s> <s>The Trump administration has cancelled Mars Sample Return, leaving Europe's Rosalind Franklin rover, with its two-metre drill, as the next chance in twenty twenty-eight.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A synthesis in Nature finds that meal timing, not diet composition, dominates the rhythms of liver genes in animal studies.</s> <s>Feeding and fasting cycles reset the peripheral circadian clocks in liver, gut, and fat tissue, with measurable effects on insulin resistance.</s> <s>Whether the effect scales to humans remains the open question in ongoing clinical trials — though for those observing Ramadan, the mechanism will sound familiar.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Five climate datasets now rate twenty twenty-six the second-warmest year on record, even as La Niña held the first quarter cooler than expected.</s> <s>Researchers project a super El Niño in autumn will push global temperatures higher, giving this year a nineteen percent chance of beating twenty twenty-four.</s> <s>The likelier all-time record, they say, is twenty twenty-seven.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Australia's eSafety commissioner has issued binding transparency notices to four gaming platforms — Roblox, Minecraft, Fortnite, and Steam — under the Online Safety Act.</s> <s>Nine in ten Australians aged eight to seventeen play online, and this is the first time gaming companies, not social-media firms, have been compelled to document grooming and abuse controls.</s> <s>Roblox separately faces twenty-three million dollars in US state settlements and one hundred forty federal lawsuits.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Indonesia now hosts one hundred seventy data centres, and each medium-sized facility draws three hundred thousand gallons of water a day — the equivalent of one thousand households.</s> <s>Nearly half sit in the country's hottest regions, and as Singapore tightens its own rules, capacity is flowing to Batam.</s> <s>The AI boom's water cost is being paid by communities that will never run the models.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>